# Tests live in the owning sibling

A registry root has no product test suite. After a behavior change, test
inside the workspace that owns the code.

| Area | Gate |
| --- | --- |
| `masstrade-ops/tofu/` | `tofu validate` / `tofu plan` only when the remote URL is set; never apply as a "test" |
| MassTrade PHP | that product's PHPUnit / PHPStan — see the MassTrade `AGENTS.md` |
| OpenCode sidebar | that repo's npm/bun tests |
| Registry-only docs/rules | no test run |

Skip tests only for docs, comments, or formatting. Do not invent a new
analyzer gate at a registry root until a kit exists.
